		{
			description: [
				"It holds the seeds of forests that burned."
				""
				"Before the devastation the elves kept a seed-archive of every forest in the Nine Realms. Three trees are what survived of it, and their leaves still carry other forests' seeds."
				""
				"PETALS: orange and yellow, about 10% per leaf."
				"FOREIGN SEEDS: acacia, jungle, oak — about 5.5% per leaf. These are ordinary saplings and they grow normally, which is how Alfheim gets oak, apples and plank variety at all."
				"ITS OWN SAPLING: about 3% per leaf, so a grove can be replanted."
				""
				"FOUND IN: sundered highlands, ashen grove, alfheim hills."
			]
			icon: "alfheim:emberbark_sapling"
			id: "1DC5039E0658661D"
			optional: true
